abstract: >-
  Code, deterministic split manifests, aggregate results, figures, and audit
  documentation for a study of whether uncertainty-based acceptance thresholds
  calibrated on familiar materials preserve absolute retained-set error targets
  across element and composition-cluster shifts in two Matbench regression
  tasks.
